Complete corresponding source of Puron @VERSION@

The complete corresponding source of the programs in this package is
Puron's full source with its locked Rust dependencies. It is the release
asset puron-@VERSION@-source.tar.xz of the tag v@VERSION@:

  https://github.com/elalonde/puron/releases/tag/v@VERSION@

The archive builds offline with cargo build --offline --locked --release.
This offer serves the GPL-3.0 terms of puron-applet, the relinking terms
of the LGPL-2.1 udisks2 crate and the MPL-2.0 terms of the libcosmic
crates.
